+
+**Fairness and implementation.** The 22-line wrapper inherits the official agent and only forces `history_n=1` plus supplies `env.tools` as the registry would ([wrapper:15](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/eval/mobileworld/maiui_mw_agent.py:15), [registry:140](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/tools/MobileWorld/src/mobile_world/agents/registry.py:140)). The pinned official default is three images; its prompt, history handling, parser, action mapping, temperature 0/top_p 1/2,048-token cap remain inherited ([official defaults:134](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/tools/MobileWorld/src/mobile_world/agents/implementations/mai_ui_agent.py:134)). All **4,125 logged message blocks** contain one image. Thus this is the official implementation with a declared configuration change, not its native three-image result.
