+
+Reproduction: `python3 -B results/codex/mw_maiui_audit/recompute.py`. It uses only the standard library and local files, independently parses results, computes the exact binomial test by recurrence, and checks historical decisions. Supporting outputs: [recomputed.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/mw_maiui_audit/recomputed.json), [attempts.csv](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/mw_maiui_audit/attempts.csv), [events.jsonl](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/mw_maiui_audit/events.jsonl), and [source hashes](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/mw_maiui_audit/source_hashes.json). The late Qwen/SendForms attempts lack pulled screenshots, and emulator/server-side logs are unavailable; this audit verifies recorded checker outcomes and client-side execution evidence, not every UI/checker judgment or the KVM root cause.

